    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"page\" id=\"page-grove-elemental\">\n  <div class=\"page-header\">\n    <div class=\"page-eyebrow\">Construct / Frontline Bruiser · CR 11 · XP 7,200</div>\n    <div class=\"page-title\">Bound Grove Elemental</div>\n    <div class=\"page-subtitle\">An elemental imprisoned in living wood by the Bind the Elemental Root spell — nature's force turned against nature's freedom</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"lore-box\"><p>\"The elemental did not want to be in the tree. After sufficient time, it stopped wanting at all. This is what I call integration.\" — D.C., field notes</p></div>\n\n  <div class=\"stat-block\">\n    <div class=\"sb-head\">\n      <div class=\"sb-name\">Bound Grove Elemental</div>\n      <div class=\"sb-type\">Large elemental (plant), neutral (bound)</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">CR 11</span><span class=\"tag\">7,200 XP</span><span class=\"tag tag-green\">Elemental / Plant</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sb-body\">\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Armor Class</div><div class=\"attr-val\">16 (natural armor)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Hit Points</div><div class=\"attr-val\">184 (16d10 + 96)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Speed</div><div class=\"attr-val\">30 ft</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"core-stats\">\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">STR</div><div class=\"cs-val\">22</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+6)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">DEX</div><div class=\"cs-val\">8</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–1)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CON</div><div class=\"cs-val\">22</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+6)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">INT</div><div class=\"cs-val\">6</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–2)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">WIS</div><div class=\"cs-val\">10</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+0)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CHA</div><div class=\"cs-val\">7</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–2)</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Immunities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">Varies by bound elemental type (fire elemental = fire; earth = poison; air = lightning; water = cold)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Resistances</div><div class=\"attr-val\">bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing from nonmagical weapons</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Condition Immunities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">exhaustion, frightened, grappled, paralyzed, petrified, poisoned, prone, restrained, unconscious</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Senses</div><div class=\"attr-val\">darkvision 60 ft, tremorsense 60 ft, passive Perception 10</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Special Traits</div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Elemental Nature</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">The grove elemental doesn't require air, food, drink, or sleep. The elemental bound within the wood causes faint elemental energy to seep from the bark: warmth (fire), a low hum (air), moisture (water), or a mineral smell (earth). Animals within 30 ft instinctively flee.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">False Appearance</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">While motionless in a forest or garden, the bound grove elemental is indistinguishable from an ordinary (if unusually large and geometrically symmetrical) tree. Nature (DC 16) to detect the wrongness of its symmetry.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Siege Monster</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">The grove elemental deals double damage to objects and structures.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Rooted Resilience</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">At the start of each of its turns, if the grove elemental is standing on earth or natural ground, it regains 5 hit points.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Actions</div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Multiattack</div><p class=\"action-desc\">The grove elemental makes two Slam attacks.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Slam</div><p class=\"action-desc\"><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +10 to hit, reach 10 ft, one target. <em>Hit:</em> 19 (3d8 + 6) bludgeoning damage plus 9 (2d8) elemental damage (type determined by bound elemental: fire, lightning, cold, or acid).</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Entangle Eruption <em>(Recharge 5–6)</em></div><p class=\"action-desc\">Roots erupt in a 20-ft radius centered on the elemental. Each creature in that area must succeed on a DC 18 Strength saving throw or be restrained for 1 minute (escape DC 18 Athletics). The area becomes difficult terrain.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Elemental Discharge <em>(Recharge 6)</em></div><p class=\"action-desc\">The bound elemental's energy erupts in a 30-ft cone. Each creature in the cone must make a DC 17 Dexterity save, taking 42 (12d6) elemental damage on a failed save, or half on a success.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "public": ""
